realized he had a gift for coding and hired a tutor to work with him once

11
00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:11.409
a week. He was soon taking an advanced computer class at a local college. At the

12
00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:19.162
age of 12, Mark solved a problem in his father’s dental office, which was connected to the

13
