had an idea for a social networking site called ConnectU. They turned to Mark for programming help,

35
00:03:53.613 --> 00:03:59.778
and he did some work for them. But before the site got off the ground, Mark

36
00:03:59.779 --> 00:04:06.180
and some friends launched their own site: Facebook. As most people probably know by now, the

37
00:04:06.181 --> 00:04:11.686
