38
00:04:11.687 --> 00:04:15.921
and pictures they’ve posted on their Facebook pages. Friends can also write their own comments and

39
00:04:15.922 --> 00:04:19.354
post pictures to a user’s page. At Harvard, Facebook's popularity grew quickly. BEN: Were the ConnectU

40
