founders upset with Mark? OLIVIA: They certainly were. They thought Mark had stolen their ideas, so

41
00:04:25.852 --> 00:04:30.079
they sued Facebook. Meanwhile Facebook soon expanded to other colleges. Although Mark had only finished two

42
