years of college, he decided to leave Harvard to work on Facebook full time. He and his

43
00:04:39.486 --> 00:04:46.739
friends moved to California. In 2010 the story of Facebook’s founding was turned into a movie

44
00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:53.222
called The Social Network . People who know Mark say that he’s very different from the

45
00:04:53.223 --> 00:04:58.070
