46
00:04:58.071 --> 00:05:03.701
Mark’s clothes. He usually wears a hooded sweatshirt, t-shirt, jeans, and sneakers. In 2012 he even

47
00:05:03.702 --> 00:05:11.152
wore that outfit to meet with investors interested in purchasing Facebook stock. But he did put

48
00:05:11.153 --> 00:05:16.302
on a suit and tie when he got married that same year! Since its creation Facebook

49
00:05:16.303 --> 00:05:26.885
has grown at an incredible rate. By 2015 it had about 1.35 billion users around the globe!

50
00:05:26.886 --> 00:05:36.124
While it's a huge success, and many people clearly enjoy using the site, Facebook has been

51
00:05:36.125 --> 00:05:41.447
criticized often for its privacy policies. Many critics feel that Facebook has not done enough to

52
00:05:41.448 --> 00:05:45.031
protect its users' privacy. Facebook has certainly made Mark rich. In early 2015 he was estimated

53
00:05:45.032 --> 00:05:57.934
to be worth $33.4 billion, which made him number 16 on Forbes magazine’s list of the

54
00:05:57.935 --> 00:06:09.159
